    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. it doesn't feel like a shift. it just feels like... empty. the more lights go out, the harder it is to even pretend i'm still in there. sometimes i look at the dark rooms and they just seem so much quieter and easier than trying to stumble around in the dim light. it feels like a relief to just let it go dark.",
